(6821868, 1026204, 10848, '<td valign="top">I am guessing the mystery word is "son". Gorgeous images, great contrast and composition. I like the dreamy effect of this.</td>', 'I am guessing the mystery word is "son". Gorgeous images, great contrast and composition. I like the dreamy effect of this.', '2012-07-20 01:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821875, 1025894, 10848, '<td valign="top">Mystery word I am assuming..escape or freedom? This is very nice, the sepia tone adds a nostalgic feel to the image. The bird in flight with the little child running free, the cliff jumper, the swimmer all very well composed to give the sense of freedom to me. The grain effect works very well with this image.</td>', 'Mystery word I am assuming..escape or freedom? This is very nice, the sepia tone adds a nostalgic feel to the image. The bird in flight with the little child running free, the cliff jumper, the swimmer all very well composed to give the sense of freedom to me. The grain effect works very well with this image.', '2012-07-20 01:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821877, 1026225, 10848, '<td valign="top">I am sure the word would not be flower, so I am going out on a limb here and say...delicate? The clarity is great, the DOF is wonderful giving the images a soft and delicate feel.</td>', 'I am sure the word would not be flower, so I am going out on a limb here and say...delicate? The clarity is great, the DOF is wonderful giving the images a soft and delicate feel.', '2012-07-20 01:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821878, 1025719, 10848, '<td valign="top">My guess would be "abandoned"? Like the sepia, the light in the center image is great, really gives depth and a sense of mystery.</td>', 'My guess would be "abandoned"? Like the sepia, the light in the center image is great, really gives depth and a sense of mystery.', '2012-07-20 01:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821882, 1025985, 10848, '<td valign="top">First word that comes to mind is "Chaos"? The blurred images automatically gave me the feel of movement, the center image shows the typical NY hustle and bustle. The center image is a just a little over-blown to me, just a minor adjustment in exposure, otherwise a good image.</td>', 'First word that comes to mind is "Chaos"? The blurred images automatically gave me the feel of movement, the center image shows the typical NY hustle and bustle. The center image is a just a little over-blown to me, just a minor adjustment in exposure, otherwise a good image.', '2012-07-20 01:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821884, 1026309, 10848, '<td valign="top">Relief? LOL...great captures. Love the left image, those jaws are really swinging! Middle image shows such a sense of an AWWWW moment. This is great one of my favs so far. Hope this does well.</td>', 'Relief? LOL...great captures. Love the left image, those jaws are really swinging! Middle image shows such a sense of an AWWWW moment. This is great one of my favs so far. Hope this does well.', '2012-07-20 01:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821886, 1025607, 10848, '<td valign="top">Tide? This is a little jumbled to me. If the image were more in alignment it would probably have done better. I like the way you composed your image, the softness of the left and right image are very effective.</td>', 'Tide? This is a little jumbled to me. If the image were more in alignment it would probably have done better. I like the way you composed your image, the softness of the left and right image are very effective.', '2012-07-20 01:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
