(6821915, 1025985, 108982, '<td valign="top">Rat-race or Hurried would be my guesses.  As for the entry I like the left and right panels a lot but the saturation seems pretty blown out on the center panel as compared to the others two.</td>', 'Rat-race or Hurried would be my guesses.  As for the entry I like the left and right panels a lot but the saturation seems pretty blown out on the center panel as compared to the others two.', '2012-07-20 02:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821922, 1026193, 108982, '<td valign="top">En-light-en.  Nice, took a minute but it was there.  All three photos are really good.  I like the subtleties people add either by serendipity or design.  In this case the slight greenish cast to the door on the left, the models eyes and the background in position 3.  the only thing I think detracts at all is the clash of color between the dress in position 1 and the true red on the card in 3.  all in all very cool idea...7</td>', 'En-light-en.  Nice, took a minute but it was there.  All three photos are really good.  I like the subtleties people add either by serendipity or design.  In this case the slight greenish cast to the door on the left, the models eyes and the background in position 3.  the only thing I think detracts at all is the clash of color between the dress in position 1 and the true red on the card in 3.  all in all very cool idea...7', '2012-07-20 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821927, 1025848, 108982, '<td valign="top">Dance?  really great dance shots, love that you chose B&amp;W.  I wish the actual pictures were larger or perhaps cropped as close-ups to fill each box.  I''m guessing in full size this would be spectacular.  7</td>', 'Dance?  really great dance shots, love that you chose B&W.  I wish the actual pictures were larger or perhaps cropped as close-ups to fill each box.  I''m guessing in full size this would be spectacular.  7', '2012-07-20 02:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821928, 1026231, 108982, '<td valign="top">patience...slow and steady wins the race.  lovely color and DOF.  The photos are fantastic and simply clean.  one distraction for me is the missing border on the bottom picture''s left side.  outside of that well done.</td>', 'patience...slow and steady wins the race.  lovely color and DOF.  The photos are fantastic and simply clean.  one distraction for me is the missing border on the bottom picture''s left side.  outside of that well done.', '2012-07-20 02:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821929, 1026225, 108982, '<td valign="top">Lavender...?  or Heather maybe.  I''m not good at plants.  love all three pics but they are all a little too the same for me.  That being said it is your art and clearly a very nice entry.  7</td>', 'Lavender...?  or Heather maybe.  I''m not good at plants.  love all three pics but they are all a little too the same for me.  That being said it is your art and clearly a very nice entry.  7', '2012-07-20 02:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6821932, 1025798, 108982, '<td valign="top">the only word that comes to mind is "withered".  with the heat and wind we have had here at least it would be fitting.  everything here is very withered....The B&amp;W is OK but there seems to be a lack of range of grays. it seems as though the highlights overtook the subject by blowing out the white in the back a bit too much.</td>', 'the only word that comes to mind is "withered".  with the heat and wind we have had here at least it would be fitting.  everything here is very withered....The B&W is OK but there seems to be a lack of range of grays. it seems as though the highlights overtook the subject by blowing out the white in the back a bit too much.', '2012-07-20 02:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
