(6824687, 1026203, 138630, '<td valign="top">Three.  I like the idea, the hint, the individual images, and the similarity of tone that unites them.  I think my favorite is the one on the left - such nice lines in the drooping leaves - but I''m not sure.  Maybe I''d lose the white in the upper right corner, though.</td>', 'Three.  I like the idea, the hint, the individual images, and the similarity of tone that unites them.  I think my favorite is the one on the left - such nice lines in the drooping leaves - but I''m not sure.  Maybe I''d lose the white in the upper right corner, though.', '2012-07-22 16:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6824688, 1026225, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lavender.  Or Russian Sage.  Or whatever the name of the plant is.  I always get them mixed up.  I like the variety that the different lighting and especially background colors add to the captures.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lavender.  Or Russian Sage.  Or whatever the name of the plant is.  I always get them mixed up.  I like the variety that the different lighting and especially background colors add to the captures.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-22 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6824689, 1026204, 138630, '<td valign="top">The name of the boy.  All three are very nice captures - I think he''s having a great time.  I like that you did them all in black and white and that we get closer to him in each image.  Not so sure about the blur that bleeds from the center image into the others.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The name of the boy.  All three are very nice captures - I think he''s having a great time.  I like that you did them all in black and white and that we get closer to him in each image.  Not so sure about the blur that bleeds from the center image into the others.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-22 16:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6824692, 1026194, 138630, '<td valign="top">No idea on mystery word but it doesn''t matter.  I love the grace of the wing and body positions in these captures and the black and white is very nice, too.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'No idea on mystery word but it doesn''t matter.  I love the grace of the wing and body positions in these captures and the black and white is very nice, too.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-22 16:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
