(6825175, 1026055, 138630, '<td valign="top">Woods?  Lovely images, very restful both individually and as a composite.  I like the narrow crops here, giving us just a slice of each space and suggesting maybe the height of the trees.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Woods?  Lovely images, very restful both individually and as a composite.  I like the narrow crops here, giving us just a slice of each space and suggesting maybe the height of the trees.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-23 09:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825178, 1026301, 138630, '<td valign="top">Tracks.  This is very lovely.  The textures of the sand, the play of light and shadows on the ripples, the simple interest of the tracks themselves that evoke images of the animals and vehicle that have gone before all work well together for me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Tracks.  This is very lovely.  The textures of the sand, the play of light and shadows on the ripples, the simple interest of the tracks themselves that evoke images of the animals and vehicle that have gone before all work well together for me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-23 09:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825191, 1026072, 138630, '<td valign="top">Safe?  Nice action shots - they are really into it!  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Safe?  Nice action shots - they are really into it!  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-23 09:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825192, 1026186, 138630, '<td valign="top">The hint made me think "rotten" and maybe that''s it but Apple seems more like it.  Unless it''s a different fruit - doesn''t really look like an apple.  Anyway, the blur and desaturated tones that bind these three images and the layout are all very nice. Voted earlier.</td>', 'The hint made me think "rotten" and maybe that''s it but Apple seems more like it.  Unless it''s a different fruit - doesn''t really look like an apple.  Anyway, the blur and desaturated tones that bind these three images and the layout are all very nice. Voted earlier.', '2012-07-23 09:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825195, 1025620, 138630, '<td valign="top">Hunting.  Clever clue and nice images.  I especially like the frog.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Hunting.  Clever clue and nice images.  I especially like the frog.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-23 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825198, 1026304, 138630, '<td valign="top">Model A?  (or whatever the make is - I''m not at all good with cars).  Good idea to take detail shots from the same car - adds both interest and unity.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Model A?  (or whatever the make is - I''m not at all good with cars).  Good idea to take detail shots from the same car - adds both interest and unity.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-23 09:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
