(6825523, 1025620, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>I don''t know if it''s the combination of the photos or the cropping, but the top insects aren''t as sharp as I''d like them. The one on the left looks a little blown out on the tail and slightly out of focus.<br/> <br/>That being said, I still find this to be the best photo in the challenge. The story is there and it''s compelling.  Will the frog get the meal or not?</td>', '#1I don''t know if it''s the combination of the photos or the cropping, but the top insects aren''t as sharp as I''d like them. The one on the left looks a little blown out on the tail and slightly out of focus. That being said, I still find this to be the best photo in the challenge. The story is there and it''s compelling.  Will the frog get the meal or not?', '2012-07-23 16:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825525, 1026204, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another.<br/>Not a fan of the heavy use of the blur brush, or whatever you actually used, but a solid image nevertheless. I think the strong second image is what really makes this composition work.</td>', '#2, tied with another.Not a fan of the heavy use of the blur brush, or whatever you actually used, but a solid image nevertheless. I think the strong second image is what really makes this composition work.', '2012-07-23 16:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825527, 1026231, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another.<br/>Nothing really to say. Simple and effective. Can''t rate this with my #1 only because it''s boring, in a good way. This is one of those photos you''d hand in your kitchen or dining room, but doesn''t ask for a conversation to be spoken about it. For that reason I knocked it down to second place in my books.</td>', '#2, tied with another.Nothing really to say. Simple and effective. Can''t rate this with my #1 only because it''s boring, in a good way. This is one of those photos you''d hand in your kitchen or dining room, but doesn''t ask for a conversation to be spoken about it. For that reason I knocked it down to second place in my books.', '2012-07-23 16:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6825529, 1026145, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3<br/>To bad this couldn''t be an infinitetych. It''d still be easy to shot for. <br/>I simply like the subject matter of yours. I think the middle panel should have the subject also looking at their device like you have the two ends.</td>', '#3To bad this couldn''t be an infinitetych. It''d still be easy to shot for. I simply like the subject matter of yours. I think the middle panel should have the subject also looking at their device like you have the two ends.', '2012-07-23 16:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
