(6825691, 1026012, 103142, '<td valign="top">gritty, powerful, and creepy. I hate to see this expressed in photography, and I wonder what the girl thinks of herself in this series. I also wonder if you''re getting marked down for touching a taboo subject. If it makes people flinch, are they seeing that as a negative or a positive in the voting process.<br/> <br/>Abuse, I assume.<br/> <br/>This should take blue with a high 7 or 8.<br/> <br/>I also think it should be sent out to shelters and agencies and put on billboards. Very powerful stuff. Fascinating decision on the crop on the left. I so badly want to see the eyes. It draws you in even more.</td>', 'gritty, powerful, and creepy. I hate to see this expressed in photography, and I wonder what the girl thinks of herself in this series. I also wonder if you''re getting marked down for touching a taboo subject. If it makes people flinch, are they seeing that as a negative or a positive in the voting process. Abuse, I assume. This should take blue with a high 7 or 8. I also think it should be sent out to shelters and agencies and put on billboards. Very powerful stuff. Fascinating decision on the crop on the left. I so badly want to see the eyes. It draws you in even more.', '2012-07-23 19:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
