(6826693, 1026324, 112739, '<td valign="top">Elements. I think this will do well. I love the comp and the RBG color scheme. The backlighting  also takes the minds eye to the main subject. Well done!</td>', 'Elements. I think this will do well. I love the comp and the RBG color scheme. The backlighting  also takes the minds eye to the main subject. Well done!', '2012-07-25 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
