(6827008, 1026321, 61396, '<td valign="top">You have created one of the most compelling sequences I have seen around here for a long time. Each of the images make me long to zoom out and see a little bit more of the picture - a notion excelled by that image at the bottom.<br/> <br/>The fact that there is a word tying this all together is a bonus I am deprived of at the moment, but I am hopeful to decipher it later in the week.<br/> <br/>ETA: giving up on the mystery word, though I feel that I could be enlightened by simply zooming out on that task too. <br/> <br/>Thank you.</td>', 'You have created one of the most compelling sequences I have seen around here for a long time. Each of the images make me long to zoom out and see a little bit more of the picture - a notion excelled by that image at the bottom. The fact that there is a word tying this all together is a bonus I am deprived of at the moment, but I am hopeful to decipher it later in the week. ETA: giving up on the mystery word, though I feel that I could be enlightened by simply zooming out on that task too.  Thank you.', '2012-07-25 12:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
