(6827105, 1025791, 138253, '<td valign="top">Not sure what mystery word you''re going for here: fetch, play, toy, success, achievement....<br/>I like the story, though the first one is too dark in my opinion - more detail on the head would be better - 1/2 or more of the face is lost in shadow, and too much of the rest of the frame is negative space.</td>', 'Not sure what mystery word you''re going for here: fetch, play, toy, success, achievement....I like the story, though the first one is too dark in my opinion - more detail on the head would be better - 1/2 or more of the face is lost in shadow, and too much of the rest of the frame is negative space.', '2012-07-25 14:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6827108, 1026012, 138253, '<td valign="top">Unsure what exactly you''re going for here - violence, pain, abuse, anger, resentment, broken, rough...<br/>overall this picture is technically sound but too dark for my taste - the notion of abusing the young girl is unforgivable to me as an action; the red border makes the eyes look very evil in the first frame, yet do not stand out enough for the rest of the image to be distinct borders when focusing on the subject of the image.<br/>i''d give this a 6 on the technicals overall (8 for the photographic skill) but a 1 if i was voting for ''what this image stirs in me''. i''m quite torn on how to vote it as i don''t like promoting this for the content (despite the fact the title says it''s intolerable), but would hate to see it end up too low as it has better technicals than many others i''ve seen...</td>', 'Unsure what exactly you''re going for here - violence, pain, abuse, anger, resentment, broken, rough...overall this picture is technically sound but too dark for my taste - the notion of abusing the young girl is unforgivable to me as an action; the red border makes the eyes look very evil in the first frame, yet do not stand out enough for the rest of the image to be distinct borders when focusing on the subject of the image.i''d give this a 6 on the technicals overall (8 for the photographic skill) but a 1 if i was voting for ''what this image stirs in me''. i''m quite torn on how to vote it as i don''t like promoting this for the content (despite the fact the title says it''s intolerable), but would hate to see it end up too low as it has better technicals than many others i''ve seen...', '2012-07-25 14:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
